OL,3,GGrampian                               
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry, cold and sunny    
OL,6,Fday. Clouding over at times along      
OL,7,Fcoastal districts with the chance of a 
OL,8,Flight shower this afternoon. Light     
OL,9,Fwinds.                                 
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.     
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry 
OL,13,Falthough clouding over at times with   
OL,14,Fthe odd light shower across the east.  
OL,15,FWidespread frost.                      
OL,17,CSunday:FChance of the odd light shower 
OL,18,Fin the east, otherwise a dry day with  
OL,19,Fsome spells of sunshine.               
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
